The '''Nagur Pact''' was a collective defense treaty signed in [[Nagur]], between [[Astamon]], [[Gosaria]], [[Imendia]], and [[Qym]] in {{abbr|2327|1933 (Earth Year Equivalent)}}. It was eventually joined by [[Tamodia]] (DAY MONTH {{abbr|2329|1935 (Earth Year Equivalent)}}), [[Thyon]] (DAY MONTH {{abbr|2329|1935 (Earth Year Equivalent)}}), [[Nykal]] (DAY MONTH {{abbr|2334|1939 (Earth Year Equivalent)}}), [[Afarut]] (DAY MONTH {{abbr|2334|1939 (Earth Year Equivalent)}}), [[PAHARIAN COUNTRY]] (DAY MONTH {{abbr|2347|1949.7 (Earth Year Equivalent)}}), [[VISALIAN COUNTRY]] (DAY MONTH {{abbr|2350|1952.2 (Earth Year Equivalent)}}), and [[VISALIAN COUNTRY]] (DAY MONTH {{abbr|2353|1954.7 (Earth Year Equivalent)}}). The Nagur Pact was renewed periodically until it expired in {{abbr|2367|1966.3 (Earth Year Equivalent)}}, during the [[Austral War]]. The Nagur Pact was led by its original members and represented one of the two sides fighting the [[Boreal War]]. 

